      "dcterms:identifier": "https://arxiv.org/abs/math/0610591",
      "dcterms:abstract": "Complete proofs of Schur–Weyl duality in positive characteristic are scarce in the literature. The purpose of this sur- vey is to write out the details of such a proof, deriving the result in positive characteristic from the classical result in characteristic zero, using only known facts from representation theory.",
